        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>ABH 0370 Floor Mounted Center Hung Pivot Set</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese heavy duty floor mounted center hung door pivots are engineered for durability on interior or exterior doors weighing up to 500 pounds. Set includes <a href=\"/products/heavy-door-center-hung-top-pivot-hinge-abh-0340\">ABH 0340 top pivot</a> and bottom pivot with installation hardware.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ABH-0370-pivot_size.gif?v=1704354642\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ABH 0370 Floor Mounted Center Hung Pivot Set Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe bottom door pivot is mounted to the floor. Top pivot is mortised into the door's header.  <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=519415\"><b>ABH Door Pivots</b></a> are Made in the USA and available in 8 finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for ABH 0370 Center Hung Pivot Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Weight: Up to 500 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Exterior or Interior Door Size: Up to 4'0\" x 8'6\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Full Mortise, Center Hung</li>\r\n<li>Bottom Pivot: Floor Mounted</li>\r\n<li>Top Pivot: Walking beam type hinge</li>\r\n<li>Dress plate provided for jamb portion</li>\r\n<li><b>Non-Handed, Reversible </b></li>\r\n<li>BHMA/ANSI C07032</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/0370-install.pdf?v=1691093120\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH 0370 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/0370-template.pdf?v=1691093120\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH 0370 Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually <b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Heavy Door Center Hung Pivot Set, ABH 0370",
